# graphify scope. Docs/text ARE indexed (semantic extraction via the configured LLM
# backend — DeepSeek), so markdown spec, knowledge/ topics, README, etc. become graph
# nodes linked to the code. Honoured on top of .gitignore (last-match-wins), so all
# git-ignored paths (_nogit_* strategic docs, .env*, jitendex/, scratch/, node_modules/,
# venv/) stay OUT of the graph and are read directly per the AETHEL graphify-first carve-out.
#
# Images stay excluded: the DeepSeek backend is text-only (no vision/OCR). To index
# images too, switch to a vision backend (claude-cli / gemini) and drop these lines.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.svg
*.webp
*.ico
*.gif
